  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e1ca3afc4caf41b1b42aa68d0b30a0a2, type: 3}
  m_Name: PriyaPatel
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ResumeData
  applicantName: Priya Patel
  body: '<b>PRIYA PATEL</b>

    Applying for: Junior Gameplay Programmer


    <b>EXPERIENCE</b>

    Gameplay
    Programmer - Honkworks Interactive

    {dates_honk}

    Shipped: {shipped_goose}


    <b>SKILLS</b>

    {skill_csharp},
    Unity, {skill_shaders}


    <b>EDUCATION</b>

    {edu}


    <b>REFERENCES</b>

    {ref}'
  claims:
  - id: dates_honk
    text: Feb 2023 - Present
    isSuspicious: 0
    category: 1
    designerNote: 
    suspiciousQuestion:
      question: You're still at Honkworks. Why leave?
      answer: They make everyone {h_honk} at the start of every meeting. I'm ready
        for a quieter studio.
      demeanor: 2
      phrases:
      - id: h_honk
        text: honk
        isContradiction: 0
        callOutResponse: I wish I was joking. There's a honk-off at the Christmas
          party. I came second.
        callOutDemeanor: 2
    goodQuestion:
      question: Three years at Honkworks, nice. What did you work on?
      answer: Mostly goose AI. Making geese angry in a believable way is harder than
        it sounds.
      demeanor: 1
      phrases: []
  - id: shipped_goose
    text: 'Goose Simulator 3: Honk Harder'
    isSuspicious: 0
    category: 0
    designerNote: Sounds absurd, but it is true. A good mark here is correct.
    suspiciousQuestion:
      question: '''Goose Simulator 3: Honk Harder''? Is that a real game?'
      answer: It's real! It sold {g_sales}. I'm in the credits as {g_credit}.
      demeanor: 2
      phrases:
      - id: g_sales
        text: two million copies
        isContradiction: 0
        callOutResponse: It's a big goose community. Very passionate. Slightly scary.
        callOutDemeanor: 2
      - id: g_credit
        text: Senior Goose Behavior Engineer
        isContradiction: 0
        callOutResponse: That's what the credits say! My real title was Junior Programmer.
          The geese got the senior titles.
        callOutDemeanor: 2
    goodQuestion:
      question: Tell me about Goose Simulator 3.
      answer: I programmed the honk system. Every honk is procedurally generated.
        No two honks are the same.
      demeanor: 1
      phrases: []
  - id: skill_csharp
    text: C# (3 years)
    isSuspicious: 0
    category: 4
    designerNote: 
    suspiciousQuestion:
      question: Prove you know C#. What's a null reference?
      answer: It's when you {n_ask} for something that isn't there. Like asking my
        old manager for a raise.
      demeanor: 2
      phrases:
      - id: n_ask
        text: ask
        isContradiction: 0
        callOutResponse: ...It was a joke. About the raise. I do know C#. Please.
        callOutDemeanor: 2
    goodQuestion:
      question: How do you like C#?
      answer: I love it. I have a C# sticker on my laptop. And my car. And my cat's
        carrier.
      demeanor: 1
      phrases: []
  - id: skill_shaders
    text: Shader programming
    isSuspicious: 0
    category: 4
    designerNote: 
    suspiciousQuestion:
      question: Shaders are hard. Do you actually know shader programming?
      answer: A little. I {s_wrote} for the geese. It's not my strongest skill, but
        I'm learning.
      demeanor: 2
      phrases:
      - id: s_wrote
        text: wrote the feather shader
        isContradiction: 0
        callOutResponse: I did! It's why the geese look so fluffy and menacing.
        callOutDemeanor: 2
    goodQuestion:
      question: Shaders! What have you made?
      answer: A feather shader. The geese shimmer menacingly in the sunlight.
      demeanor: 1
      phrases: []
  - id: edu
    text: B.Sc. Computer Science, Riverside University (2022)
    isSuspicious: 0
    category: 0
    designerNote: 
    suspiciousQuestion:
      question: Did you actually finish your degree?
      answer: Yes, in 2022. I {e_cried} at the ceremony.
      demeanor: 2
      phrases:
      - id: e_cried
        text: cried a normal amount
        isContradiction: 0
        callOutResponse: Okay, a lot. My mom cried more. The dean also cried. It
          was a lot of crying.
        callOutDemeanor: 2
    goodQuestion:
      question: Tell me about university.
      answer: I studied computer science and ran the game dev club. We made a game
        about a sad potato.
      demeanor: 1
      phrases: []
  - id: ref
    text: Dana Reyes, Lead Programmer at Honkworks
    isSuspicious: 0
    category: 5
    designerNote: 
    suspiciousQuestion:
      question: Is Dana Reyes a real person?
      answer: Yes! Dana was my lead. You can call her. She'll probably honk first,
        it's a company thing.
      demeanor: 2
      phrases: []
    goodQuestion:
      question: Will Dana Reyes speak well of you?
      answer: I think so. I fixed the bug where the geese flew backwards. She was
        very grateful.
      demeanor: 1
      phrases: []
  referenceLetter: 'To whom it may concern,


    Priya was a gameplay programmer
    on my team at Honkworks Interactive. She fixed {rl_geese} and shipped on time.


    I
    would {rl_hire}. Honk.


    Dana Reyes

    Lead Programmer, Honkworks'
